{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "deck",
			"type": "text",
			"color": "3",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -1180,
			"width": 1000,
			"height": 460,
			"text": "#deck\n\ntheme: Atlas/Themes/Paper.css\naccent: #1D5A78\ntransition: slide\nheader position: top-centre\n\n# Atlas Presenter\nEverything it does, in one canvas · *{section}*\n\n%% advance: 8s — uncomment for an unattended screen %%"
		},
		{
			"id": "a1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "#title\n\n# A deck is a queue. Your thinking is a graph.\n\nOne of those two is lying to the room.\n\n%%Open on the question, not the agenda. Roughly forty seconds here.%%",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "a2",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Atlas/Assets/00-motion.html",
			"x": 1520,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "a3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "#section\n\n## How the map works",
			"x": 3040,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720
		},
		{
			"id": "b1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Arrows are the running order\n\nDepth first — a branch is told to its end before the next one starts.\n\n+++\n\nLabel an arrow `1.` `2.` to force it.\n\n+++\n\nA canvas with no arrows still presents, in reading order.\n\n%%Three reveals here. Pause after each one.%%",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1180,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "b2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Groups are sections\n\nThe camera frames the whole group before diving in, and the section name\nsits above it on the map — so it can be read *before* you enter it.\n\nPress `O` at any point to pull back to the whole map.",
			"x": 1520,
			"y": 1180,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "b3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Press `M`\n\nEvery card, drawn to scale, with its title and its number.\nClick one to fly there. `Backspace` lands you back exactly where you were.\n\n%%This is the feature nothing else has. Demonstrate it — jump to the last\ncard and come back.%%",
			"x": 3040,
			"y": 1180,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "c1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "#section\n\n## Pictures",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 2360,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720
		},
		{
			"id": "c2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Four images, one card\n\n<div class=\"atl-slideshow\">\n  <img src=\"Atlas/Assets/site-1.svg\">\n  <img src=\"Atlas/Assets/site-2.svg\">\n  <img src=\"Atlas/Assets/site-3.svg\">\n  <img src=\"Atlas/Assets/site-4.svg\">\n</div>\n\n%%Arrows, dots and swipe all work. Five transitions in settings.%%",
			"x": 1520,
			"y": 2360,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "c3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "#skip-short\n\n## Or all at once\n\n<div class=\"atl-gallery\">\n  <img src=\"Atlas/Assets/site-1.svg\">\n  <img src=\"Atlas/Assets/site-2.svg\">\n  <img src=\"Atlas/Assets/site-3.svg\">\n  <img src=\"Atlas/Assets/site-4.svg\">\n</div>",
			"x": 3040,
			"y": 2360,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "c4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "#full\n\n![[surfaces.svg]]",
			"x": 4560,
			"y": 2360,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "d1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "#section\n\n## Media",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 3540,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720
		},
		{
			"id": "d2",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Atlas/Assets/tone.wav",
			"x": 1520,
			"y": 3540,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "d3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Media plays itself\n\nAudio and video start when the camera arrives and pause when it leaves,\nso nothing runs off-screen. Clicking the controls does **not** advance\nthe slide.\n\nThe card to the left is a generated tone — audio with no picture, shown\nas a slim bar rather than a black rectangle.\n\n*No video ships with the demo. Drop any `.mp4` on the canvas and it\nbehaves the same way.*",
			"x": 3040,
			"y": 3540,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "d4",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Atlas/Assets/surfaces.svg",
			"x": 4560,
			"y": 3540,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "e1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "#section\n\n## The vault is still there",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 4720,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720
		},
		{
			"id": "e2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Read a note without leaving\n\nClick **[[Northwind Depot Plan]]** — the whole note opens over the\nslide. Wheel or `↓` to scroll, `Esc` to land back on this card.\n\n%%Someone always asks for the detail. This is the answer.%%",
			"x": 1520,
			"y": 4720,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "e3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Press `G` for the whole vault\n\nObsidian's own graph view, with a way back. Any note, not just the ones\non this canvas.",
			"x": 3040,
			"y": 4720,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "e4",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Atlas/Northwind Depot Plan.md",
			"x": 4560,
			"y": 4720,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"subpath": "#Why the activity code",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "f1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "#section\n\n## Cards can be more",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 5900,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720
		},
		{
			"id": "f2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "#skip-short\n\n## A card longer than the screen\n\nIt scrolls in place — one long thought stays one card instead of being\nchopped across five.\n### Part 1\n\nPressing `→` moves this card a screenful at a time and only leaves once it reaches the bottom. Coming back from the next card lands you at the bottom, where you left it.\n\n### Part 2\n\nPressing `→` moves this card a screenful at a time and only leaves once it reaches the bottom. Coming back from the next card lands you at the bottom, where you left it.\n\n### Part 3\n\nPressing `→` moves this card a screenful at a time and only leaves once it reaches the bottom. Coming back from the next card lands you at the bottom, where you left it.\n\n### Part 4\n\nPressing `→` moves this card a screenful at a time and only leaves once it reaches the bottom. Coming back from the next card lands you at the bottom, where you left it.\n\n### Part 5\n\nPressing `→` moves this card a screenful at a time and only leaves once it reaches the bottom. Coming back from the next card lands you at the bottom, where you left it.\n\n### Part 6\n\nPressing `→` moves this card a screenful at a time and only leaves once it reaches the bottom. Coming back from the next card lands you at the bottom, where you left it.\n\n### Part 7\n\nPressing `→` moves this card a screenful at a time and only leaves once it reaches the bottom. Coming back from the next card lands you at the bottom, where you left it.\n",
			"x": 1520,
			"y": 5900,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "f3",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Atlas/Assets/04-fork.html",
			"x": 3040,
			"y": 5900,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720
		},
		{
			"id": "f4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "#dark\n\n## No CSS in any card\n\nEvery card here is plain markdown. A bare tag line — `#title`, `#section`,\n`#dark` — picks the treatment, and **never reaches the slide**.\n\nThe stylesheet is one file in the vault. Re-skin the whole deck without\ntouching a single note.",
			"x": 4560,
			"y": 5900,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720
		},
		{
			"id": "g1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "#stat\n\n# 24,173\n\nof 24,180 activity codes survived the re-import. Task ids that survived: none.",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 7080,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "g2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "#quote\n\n> The map you authored is the map you navigate.",
			"x": 1520,
			"y": 7080,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720
		},
		{
			"id": "g3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Nothing points here\n\nNo arrow reaches this card. It is still on the map.\n\nPress `M`, click it, answer the question, `Backspace` home.\n\n%%Keep the awkward question on a card nobody walks past by accident.%%",
			"x": 4560,
			"y": 7080,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 720,
			"color": "1"
		},
